# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  SECRETS — copy to `.env.secrets`, which is git-ignored.
#  Loaded on top of `.env` by next.config.ts and by both
#  compose files. See AGENTS.md §5.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The lead archive's only credential. It is the whole of the secret link handed
# to the booth lead:
#
#   http://<SERVER_HOST>:<PROD_PORT>/leads?token=<LEADS_ACCESS_TOKEN>
#
# Nothing on the kiosk links to that page. Leave this unset and the archive
# routes answer 404 to everyone, which is the safe way to fail.
#
# Generate one with:  openssl rand -hex 24
LEADS_ACCESS_TOKEN=
